> called id which would provide a character string associated to each
> grob.  That would make it easier to match up extra data after the
> fact.
>

That is a much better suggestion. I know a release date is quite near,
but it would be fantastic if this could make it into 0.9.

Anyway, thanks again for your help,
Selwyn

