I was hoping someone would reply to the contrary, but I don't think this is possible currently.  I believe the scales argument to facet_grid and facet_wrap can only affect the x and y scale, not something like the fill scale.

Perhaps you could try standardizing the data in each matrix before plotting to put them all on the same scale?

-J

