Give your lines.df the same levels as your dataset and remove the 2000 for frame B.
lines.df <- data.frame(Date=c(1992,1996,2000,1992,1996),Event=c("Cond1","Cond2","Cond3","Cond1","Cond2"), f=c("A","A","A","B","B"))

ggplot(df, aes(x=Date, y=a1)) +
 geom_point() +
 geom_vline(data=lines.df, aes(xintercept=Date, linetype=Event)) +
 facet_wrap(~f, scales="free_x")

The only trouble is that it could be very misleading having the two x-axis scales be so different... But, if that's what you want then that's what you want.

B

