The development version of ggplot2 contains geom_violin(), written and
maintained by Winston Chang. It will be released to CRAN within the
next 2 weeks if all goes well, but in the meantime you can grab the
development version and work with it as follows:

library('devtools')
dev_mode()     # should reply dev_mode: ON
install_github('ggplot2')
install_github('scales')
library('ggplot2')
library('scales')
<your code here>

For some examples, see the 0.9.0 transition guide, the latest version
of which was posted here:
http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/msg/2a6ab7a72e658c6d

HTH,
Dennis

