Subject: Re: Stacked Bar Charts
Message-ID: <ifqSJiJ6gro.2yNH93GR350J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ifqSJiJ6gro.ejuaeodMO2MJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
