This problem is probably related to using stacking with log scales. See here:
https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/issues/257

If you use position="dodge", it comes out as expected (I think):
ggplot(diamonds, aes(x=clarity, fill=cut)) + geom_bar(position="dodge") + scale_y_log10()

-Winston

